T["See Ensemble: Fashion of the Fanatic Felcyclist entry – Dusk Lily escort (Suramar -> Golk the Rumble, Azsuna) for Spare Key; then open Hidden Footlocker near 12th pillar in Karazhan Catacombs with Gift of Oddsight + Starry-Eyed Goggles"] = ""
T["Murder Row dungeon — one fortune per run from Soothsayer Sargle at the entrance (before first boss). Works on any difficulty, including Follower dungeons."] = ""
T["Murder Row dungeon — Cravitz Lorent is behind the first boss, to the left. With all 13 Sargle's Fortunes in your bags, he sells the painting for 999g instead of ~10M gold!"] = ""
T["Do NOT kill the first boss, The Questioner, on the way in. At the end of the dungeon the prisoner Mason Connery asks you to kill The Questioner and bring back his key. Kill him, return the key to Mason."] = ""
T["Mason gives this quest and a note reading 'WF, 43.4, 67.8'. It leads to the second floor of the Moonbrook inn: interact with the floorboards by the box, then turn the quest in for a Document Box. It vendors for 25g — do NOT sell it."] = ""
T["Horde: Rix Xizzix in Booty Bay, near the auction house. Alliance: Renzik \"The Shiv\" in the SI:7 building, Old Town, Stormwind. Rewards a Fractured Insignia, gold and experience."] = ""
T["The Fractured Insignia is tradeable: buy the other five or trade with friends. Combining all six teaches the Alcaz Operative Insignia toy (a Defias disguise)."] = ""
T["Requires level 14. Alliance and Horde visit the same two sites in the opposite order."] = ""
T["Take the path northeast of Sun Rock Retreat @ 50.9, 52.3 up to the camp and click the Pocket Litter on top of a box."] = ""
T["Light the fire pit in the middle of the camp with the Simple Wood and Flint and Tinder from the previous quest. Not needed for the bag."] = ""
T["From the camp, climb the hill straight north and jump across to the Mound of Dirt."] = ""
T["Jump onto the carved heads facing the Wetlands to reach the figurine. Tricky to reach safely as Horde."] = ""
T["Use the cart on the Hillsbrad side to climb into the wall, go through the room and look outside to the right for the hanging bag."] = ""
T["Click the satchel below the Messenger Bag to finish the chain and receive the Cozy Sleeping Bag."] = ""
T["Zephras Isle, Thendal Village: Ailee Farheart gives the quest; turn it in to Rorian the Dayseeker nearby for the ring. A second ring is on the top floor @ 41.7, 23.4. Wear it: several later steps only appear with the ring equipped."] = ""
T["Needed to reveal the Ancient Hilt (and several scavenger-hunt objects)."] = ""
T["Use the Night Watchman's Torch at the Ruins of Ban'aethal on Zephras Isle to uncover the Ancient Hilt, then take it to Ealaane Nimbuswalker @ 65.94, 74.37."] = ""
T["The blade (item 264501) is somewhere on Zephras Isle; four spawn points are known. Bring it to Ealaane Nimbuswalker for Eluvi'ana."] = ""
T["Horde: kill Baron Aquanis in Blackfathom Deeps for the Strange Water Globe, turn it in to Je'neu at Zoram'gar Outpost, then talk to him again to get the globe back. Alliance: combine 20 Mathystra Amulet Fragments from the naga at the Ruins of Mathystra, use the amulet at the water structure @ 58.9, 22.6 in Darkshore, kill Baron Marinous, turn his globe in to Onu at the Grove of the Ancients and talk to him again."] = ""
T["With the ring equipped and the globe in your bags, a Highborne Spirit appears and sends you to the Tower of Althalaxx in Darkshore."] = ""
T["Kill Narassin at the top of the tower for the Azsharan Key, open the strongbox behind him for the tome, then return to the Highborne Spirit."] = ""
T["Shen'dralas. He names the three cleansing items below."] = ""
T["Vault in the middle of the ground floor of the ogre temple in southern Feralas; ring buff needed to see it. Four players stand on the switches at 58.5, 71.0 (second floor), 57.3, 71.7, 59.7, 72.0 and 61.1, 73.6 and toggle them together; the fifth opens the vault."] = ""
T["Requires the quest chain ending in 'Azsharite' (starts at wowhead.com/forever/quest=2721)."] = ""
T["Drop from Anguished and Suffering Highborne after you have talked to Mordent. Ring not required; not a guaranteed drop."] = ""
T["Bring the three items and the globe; use the globe from your bags at the shrine for the Cleansed Water Globe. Show it to Mordent, who sends you to Prince Tortheldrin in Dire Maul."] = ""
T["Prince Tortheldrin only speaks of Eluvi'ana and Eluvi'tor to those Honored with his court."] = ""
T["From the Libram of Binding (drops in Dire Maul): 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 2 Large Brilliant Shard, 1 Arcane Crystal."] = ""
T["Speak with Prince Tortheldrin again for the Scrawled Note: \"As night dances on, so must day wake / To rejoin one, its pair must await / So only pure of heart may wield / Blade high or perfect dark must yield // In flames born of air it must be cast / Only then will the spirit bind at last\""] = ""
